OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested near RAF
OL,4,AFairford on suspicion of terror
OL,5,Aoffences were UK nationals from London,
OL,6,Apolice say
OL,7,
OL,8,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,10,FSunday morning are UK nationals in
OL,11,Ftheir 20s who live in London, police
OL,12,Fsay
OL,14,FThey were arrested under the Explosives
OL,15,FAct and on suspicion of preparing a
OL,16,Fterrorist act - BBC Verify has looked
OL,17,Fat the "company" vans seen nearby
