OL,4,AFairford on suspicion of terror
OL,5,Aoffences were UK nationals from London,
OL,6,Apolice say
OL,7,
OL,8,FCounter Terrorism Policing Senior
OL,9,FNational Coordinator Vicki Evans says
OL,10,Fshe is "very aware of the levels of
OL,11,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,12,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,13,Fquestions that are being raised"
OL,15,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,16,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,17,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,18,Fplans - here's the WhatsApp she sent
OL,19,Fher neighbours at 01:49 on Sunday
